      "content": "a \"quieter way\"... i think i get what you mean. it sounds like just finding a way to finally end the noise. like, if the fighting never stops and the cycle never ends, then the only way to actually find peace is to just... stop everything. permanently. does that even make sense? it just feels like the only way to actually win against this cycle is to not be in it anymore.",
